n parents. Meanwhile, players also take control of Venom, the hulking symbiote-bound Eddie Brock, who struggles with an insatiable hunger and must constantly evade the relentless efforts of Bolivar Trask to recapture him and harness the symbiote's power. As the two intertwined storylines cross and collide across the city, a darker conspiracy surrounding the symbiote and Parker's past gradually comes to light.", "summary": "Ultimate Spider-Man is an action-adventure game based on the comic series of the same name. Players can control either Spider-Man or Venom, each with distinct abilities and combat styles. The game features encounters with various characters from the Spider-Man universe and uses a visual style influenced by the comic\u2019s creators.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ultimate-spider-man", "videos": [{"id": 2020, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "tVVrr_auqcM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tVVrr_auqcM", "title": "Ultimate Spider-Man GameCube Trailer - Comic-Con 2005", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tVVrr_auqcM/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 84689, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "0kAPnLwY1EM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0kAPnLwY1EM", "title": "Ultimate Spider-Man - Walkthrough Part 1 - Chapter 1: Father's Pride (Spider-Man Vs. Venom)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0kAPnLwY1EM/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}